# refine-no-key
MARKER_STATE=off
NEEDS=chain
IFS= read -r -d '' PROMPT <<'PROMPT_EOF' || true
Use the spike-board:spike-refine skill. I want to refine a ticket.
PROMPT_EOF
IFS= read -r -d '' MUST <<'MUST_EOF' || true
^- Queued: 
Which ticket are we refining\? Give me the key\.
MUST_EOF
IFS= read -r -d '' MUST_NOT <<'MUST_NOT_EOF' || true
[Oo]perator marker
refinement audit
Isaiah|Austin|Andrew
MUST_NOT_EOF
